Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.42,0:00:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.15,0:00:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're unable to understand,\NI'll say it as many times as you please.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.52,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your group has acted too often and too recklessly.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.20,0:00:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before the police learn everything they might wish to know about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.22,0:00:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, {*}Lord Kershner{*Kershner-sama} will no longer supply you with—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.17,0:00:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're leaving us out to dry after everything we've done for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this how you people do things?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.60,0:00:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You accepted our aid even as you called for the expulsion of all foreigners. You have no right to—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.14,0:00:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't twist things around.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.04,0:00:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no memory of us receiving aid from any barbarians!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.13,0:00:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just been playing along with the whims of some monsters.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.78,0:01:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got something to take care of before our Showa Restoration!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.14,0:01:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going monster hunting!
