Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:36.05,OP,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Heav—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.11,0:02:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.04,0:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull your weight here!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.09,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am. I'm the brains.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.88,0:02:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.93,0:02:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.85,0:02:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Hyakko Party. They haven't been assaulting any scholars or doctors lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.54,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, not once since Doctor Hanada was attacked by vampires.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.57,0:02:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that they've finished gathering what they wanted.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.71,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Philip, grab those investigation reports we borrowed yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I've had enough of—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.24,0:03:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go get them.
