Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy's unusually participative.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.57,0:03:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably just 'cause he's feeling better.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.92,0:03:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever the reason, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.20,0:03:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.95,0:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, {*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.48,0:03:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My father is asking if you'd all like to join us for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.55,0:03:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds kind of formal.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.70,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And kids don't understand etiquette, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah I do!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.01,0:03:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you my perfect table manners!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.98,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We and the Professor will gladly take you up on that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'll tell my father that...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}? What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.68,0:03:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.46,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be looking forward to tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you needed?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.14,0:03:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.49,0:04:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else you need?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.56,0:04:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be all for now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.97,0:04:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.96,0:04:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.57,0:04:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you bet I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.91,0:04:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you see?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.06,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected to receive a visitor from our rivals at V Shipping!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.02,0:04:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, I wouldn't call us rivals. Our firms are both engaged in business far from home.{cps}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.48,0:04:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We ought to cooperate with each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.59,0:04:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I believe that the goods we're dealing with right now are outside your specialty.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.18,0:04:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The importation of weapons and military tech, correct?{cps}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.63,0:04:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma Company always acts while looking ten to twenty years ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.51,0:04:45.65,Default,,2,2,0,,Perhaps because of that, upper management has been forming a strong connection with the military here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.65,0:04:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say I'm quite envious.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.18,0:04:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No no, your firm has been achieving some—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.19,0:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.53,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, I made it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.91,0:05:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.99,0:05:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for stopping you out of the blue as you left your home the other day.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.92,0:05:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite the coincidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.21,0:05:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here to scout out your enemy's stronghold? How diligent.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what did you think of Alma Company?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.46,0:05:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We merely spoke on the future of the shipping industry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.30,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop kidding around.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.95,0:05:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I heard about the disappearance of Doctor Hanada.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.73,0:05:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you all alright?{normally I write this "all right," but I guess this is the exception to that rule ("all all right" looks bad)}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.92,0:05:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard that one of your employees got caught up in the incident.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your concern.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.00,0:05:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You know a lot for a reporter, I must say.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.44,0:05:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I make my living, after all.{Trying to get to the basic idea of "That's what I do", "I'm a pro at that"}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.56,0:05:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without hunting for them,\Nall kinds of rumors find their way to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.84,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ones that claim that Doctor Hanada didn't disappear, but was in fact killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.34,0:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When we met, it was the Doctor's residence you were in such a hurry to get to, wasn't it?{this thing you do with appending a period to pointed questions is non-standard, just so you know. Probably that should be reserved for "questions" without a rising tone at the end.}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.29,0:06:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You should do your cover job more convincingly, Mister Willard.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.22,0:06:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I could say the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma Company and V Shipping...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.52,0:06:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The latter certainly acts more suspicious, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.22,0:06:43.78,Default,,2,2,0,,When I saw someone who was supposed to be in Harbin wandering around Ginza in plainclothes,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.78,0:06:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but call to them.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.28,0:06:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an honor.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.36,0:06:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something quite serious happening, if they called you back.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.25,0:06:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. I'm being worked to the bone.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.07,0:06:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, congratulations on your promotion to the head of the weaponry department.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Major General Kakizaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.04,0:07:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Word always seems to reach you quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.70,0:07:06.72,Default,,2,2,0,,I was just in Ichigayadai giving some words of\Nencouragement to the man replacing me as superintendent.{"superintendent" is the title of the heads of West Point the the U.S. Naval Academy.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.72,0:07:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I consider myself very fortunate to have been enrolled while you were teaching, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.92,0:07:14.22,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Are you on your way to give encouragement to someone else?{What is this words of encouragement thing}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.22,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm heading to an inspection in Gotemba.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to an inspection in person?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.50,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Will they be demonstrating a new weapon as part of their exercises or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.91,0:07:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a military secret, so I can't say more.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.12,0:07:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.11,0:07:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you this, Iba.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.07,0:07:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing may well be able to change the nature of war.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.93,0:07:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It would have most likely been impossible for Japan to develop without assistance.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.67,0:07:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Alma Company that "assistance"?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.78,0:07:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that steering you into intelligence was a excellent idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Another great war will one day occur.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.22,0:07:59.84,Default,,2,2,0,,If we can put that weapon to use, there will be no need\Nto send our men to their death as we have before.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.84,0:08:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I must ensure that this upcoming exercise is a success.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.11,0:08:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, officers charged into the Hyakko Party's hideout,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.16,0:08:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems it was already abandoned.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.50,0:08:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything left behind?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.63,0:08:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.65,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But they do say that there were traces of a fight and something like ash near the building.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.64,0:08:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So they {\i1}were{\i0} teamed up with the vampires.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.59,0:08:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But then why have they started fighting each other?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.04,0:08:29.47,Default,,2,2,0,,After the Hyakko Party gathered the materials they needed, I suppose they had no more use for them.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.47,0:08:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, what did they do with it all?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Might Alma Company be involved?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.92,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where all the equipment they stole is?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.25,0:08:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an ambitious but upstanding firm.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're marketing a new weapon to the military right now,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.97,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and were even so kind as to tell me that there would be a demonstration in Shizuoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.50,0:08:55.16,Default,,2,2,0,,Do you think that those "upstanding" employees know that their new weapon may well be stained in blood?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.16,0:08:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely not.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.94,0:09:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But we know the shadow behind it all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And they might be at the exercise as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.82,0:09:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be a chance to hunt some royals.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.87,0:09:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So what will we do about the Hyakko Party?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.72,0:09:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think they'll view the vampires' betrayal as water under the bridge.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.78,0:09:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we split into two groups?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.20,0:09:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochizuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.84,0:09:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me a ticket to Gotemba, quick!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.37,0:09:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotemba?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.33,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to leave the capital?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to monitor Alma Company's activities there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.71,0:09:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.05,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we doing about V Shipping then?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.72,0:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be fair for us to only harass them, would it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.73,0:09:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,V Shipping and Alma Company.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.31,0:09:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of mischief are they cooking up in this country?{What on earth are they trying to make happen in this country?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.94,0:09:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What perfect table manners, young master.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, I can't use chopsticks.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.87,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And second, can I point out that this is {\i1}raw{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.65,0:10:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Japanese cooking not to your liking, perhaps?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.16,0:10:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're happy to be able to dine on the only cuisine with fish this fresh.{changed to lead into next line}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.07,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're also overjoyed at the opportunity to have so many guests for dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.38,0:10:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife suffered an early death,\Nso it's normally just me and my daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.16,0:10:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unusual, Ryouko. Usually you'd be on your second bowl of rice by now. {Even though you'll usually eat three whole bowls of rice (you're eating very slowly today).}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.07,0:10:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.18,0:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Professor, how goes your work?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem quite busy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.74,0:10:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to the privilege of using your house as a base of operations.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.13,0:10:40.48,Default,,2,2,0,,I suppose I should mention that some of our employees will be going on a business trip tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.48,0:10:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.30,0:10:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotemba, in Shizuoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.55,0:10:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a highly valued customer of ours there.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.20,0:10:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Who will you be sending?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.92,0:10:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.78,0:10:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Ryouko?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.04,0:10:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.38,0:10:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, {*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.66,0:11:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going along to babysit him.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.02,0:11:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! You don't have to worry about Yuliy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's not even fazed.{He's that kind of guy.}{As in she doesn't have to worry about someone taking him, evidenced by the fact that he doesn't give a fuck about Dorothea's boobs probably.}{A+ TL note}{yeah, this is a trope, right? all i can do is be as direct as possible and hope the viewer gets it}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.18,0:11:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, lets get back to dinner!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.19,0:11:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange girl you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'd be best off not getting any closer to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.51,0:11:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He's...{I'm ignoring the netflix subs here because there's no way to hear this line as they have it.}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.98,0:11:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.75,0:11:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Major General Kakizaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.88,0:11:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Has our new product grabbed your attention?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.48,0:11:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma Company looks forward to a fruitful business relationship.{idk how to write the "relation between us" idea in a standard way}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.51,0:11:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark of Sirius?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.84,0:11:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You still parrot such nonsense in—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.45,0:12:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not nonsense.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.63,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is what will become the foundation of our prosperity.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.04,0:12:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can lay that "foundation" with the treasure of those filthy wolves?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.61,0:12:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you rather have me sit back and watch as our race dies out?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.29,0:12:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is fate, then there is nothing to be done about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.08,0:12:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold, Yevgraf.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insolence.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.40,0:12:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've nothing more to say to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.33,0:12:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama}!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.20,0:12:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama}! {*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama}!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.87,0:12:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what we heard!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.40,0:12:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That {\i1}is{\i0} good news.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.11,0:12:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You geezers, who have lost your pride as vampires...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.66,0:12:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you aim to die out,\Ndo not drag the rest of us into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.35,0:13:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This might not have been the best idea. {I made the potential mistake of following them}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.71,0:13:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.40,0:13:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.18,0:13:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finding that difficult.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.05,0:13:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll ask. Why did you ask to be on the Gotemba team, Yuliy?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.25,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No real reason. It just seemed like I'd be able to kill a lot of vampires.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.20,0:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to rush—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.82,0:13:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.42,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit idle.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.97,0:13:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Also?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.11,0:13:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.81,0:13:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Also,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.07,0:13:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if I go, I might be able to meet my brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.47,0:14:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you'd get more business if you served alcohol during the day?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.39,0:14:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get too much business, it will become difficult to do my other job.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.15,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite thrilled, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.21,0:14:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally contribute to the organization.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.09,0:14:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too eager.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.93,0:14:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy are nothing like human villains.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, so was I.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.49,0:14:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you people thi—
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.62,0:14:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Punishment!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.93,0:14:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two different types of vampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.20,0:14:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The nobles, or Royals,\Nand the Slaves who serve them.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how we call them.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.64,0:15:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaves disguise themselves as humans and protect their eyes with specially-made lenses.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.04,0:15:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If they didn't, they'd be turned into ashes by the sun's light.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.21,0:15:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Royals?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.75,0:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're strong even without revealing their true monstrous form,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.98,0:15:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and they can move unimpeded by the sunlight.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.82,0:15:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They can blend in with humans with no difficulty.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.42,0:15:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unpleasant to think about.{philip said the old line verbatim in ep. 1}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So, has your investigation borne fruit?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.85,0:15:29.52,Default,,2,2,0,,Yes. It seems that not only have the Hyakko Party lost all of their hideouts in the capital,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.52,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have also stopped getting funds from their sponsor as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And that sponsor was?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.31,0:15:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as you'd anticipated.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.69,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma Company.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.81,0:15:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing your phone.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.71,0:15:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.35,0:15:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey boss!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.76,0:15:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them are turning to ash!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're not really dead yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.07,0:15:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So we weren't the only humans the monsters paid to work for them.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.57,0:16:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Kershner?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.92,0:16:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.96,0:16:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The president's gone to Gotemba for a test of a new weapon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,New weapon?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.84,0:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.75,0:16:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we'll be stopping for a bit while they set up the train to cross the mountain.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.25,0:16:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh! I didn't think we'd all be on the same train together!"
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm on my way to Hakone..."
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.54,0:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't work.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.81,0:16:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that looks tasty!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat in such a rush.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.27,0:16:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you've got it all over your face.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.59,0:16:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"I just bought some lunch.\NWould you like to eat it with me?"
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.95,0:16:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.15,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me through.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.37,0:16:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that you, Major?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.55,0:16:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.40,0:16:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How are things back—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.72,0:16:57.42,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There was a disaster during the exercises in Fuji!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.42,0:16:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down and tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.30,0:17:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A whole battalion of infantrymen from Fuji was killed!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.12,0:17:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.88,0:17:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We just intercepted a radio message from Gotemba to Headquarters!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.77,0:17:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"At two zero three zero last night,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.58,0:17:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,an accident occurred during the military\Nexercises at the foot of Mount Fuji,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.31,0:17:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}an accident occurred during the military\Nexercises at the foot of Mount Fuji,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.22,0:17:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and all participating infantrymen have died."
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.74,0:17:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Major General Kakizaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.50,0:17:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Major General is fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.97,0:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's already returning to the capital to report on the matter to the Emperor via a special train.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.45,0:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By train?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.45,0:17:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Major? Major Iba?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.95,0:17:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Yuliy?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.10,0:17:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell blood.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.50,0:17:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They said it was a massacre.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.49,0:18:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.28,0:18:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.84,0:18:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's the Hyakko Party.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.26,0:18:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.34,0:18:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just doing this in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.32,0:18:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They asked for money and got rejected, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.85,0:18:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If they can't get money, then what do they go for next?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.08,0:18:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Goods, equipment...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.95,0:18:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.52,0:18:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go to Yuliy and Dorothea!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.86,0:18:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Yuliy{**-san} forget something in Tokyo?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.07,0:18:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.62,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see your ticket?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.26,0:18:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, I had to change trains.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I buy a new one?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.06,0:19:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, in my bag—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.16,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like one?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.38,0:19:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.53,0:19:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself!
