Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.52,0:19:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.45,0:19:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Major General Kakizaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.44,0:19:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.34,0:19:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your new ticket.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.33,0:19:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.38,0:19:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what reason do you plan to give to the Professor for abandoning our mission?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.12,0:19:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There are vampires on this train.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.60,0:20:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't track them down any further thanks to the smoke, but they're definitely around.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be ideal to get into a fight here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.25,0:20:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go map out where the passengers are.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.25,0:20:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.36,0:20:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll stay here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.49,0:20:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you jumping onto {\i1}another{\i0} train.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.93,0:20:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.21,0:20:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.70,0:20:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The experiment ended so fast that I couldn't get enough data.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.69,0:20:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That result was all the data we need.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.65,0:20:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.66,0:20:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Personal approval from {*}Lord Kershner{*Kershner-sama}!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.73,0:20:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So once we get back to Tokyo, I can start preparations for mass-production, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.95,0:20:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate depending on a man like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.24,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is {*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama} so obsessed with an Ark that we don't even know exists?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.50,0:21:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than clinging to something like that,\NI would prefer to take us down a surer path.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.44,0:21:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, {*}Mister{*Onii-chan}. {Normally I'd go with Mister here}{I don't see any reason not to, even given what happens right after.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:21:59.97,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:21:59.95,ED,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:13.83,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}What an unbearable end
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:11.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{OP lyrics start}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:20.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}I breath out, breath out, breath out, and stop
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:27.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}As I'm fleeing from this cruel world, I fall into a deep sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:34.56,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}I hide behind the words "I'm doing my best"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.56,0:22:40.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}But in the end I do nothing but look back
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.35,0:22:45.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Even when I feel like I've been able to change,
